---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Yeast Travel" description="How Yeast Travel handles itinerary choices, analytics and route requests.">
  <article class="legal shell"><span class="eyebrow">Last updated 19 July 2026</span><h1>Privacy, in plain English.</h1><section><h2>Plans saved on your device</h2><p>Your city, day and interest choices are stored in your browser. Yeast does not require an account and does not receive this saved plan unless you submit a form.</p></section><section><h2>Privacy-friendly analytics</h2><p>If enabled, we measure page visits and product events such as plan generation, map opens, address copies and paid-offer clicks. Event properties contain route choices, not your email, WhatsApp number or precise live location.</p></section><section><h2>Forms</h2><p>A waitlist or route-request form may collect your date, party size, language and one contact method. The page explains the purpose at submission. We do not collect passport, health, payment or live-location data.</p></section><section><h2>Partner transfer</h2><p>We will not send your details to an unnamed supplier. If a licensed fulfiller is selected, we will name that organisation and ask for specific transfer consent first.</p></section><section><h2>Deletion</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@yeast.travel">hello@yeast.travel</a> to request access or deletion. A final retention period and legal entity address must be added before public production launch.</p></section></article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal{max-width:820px;padding-block:70px}.legal h1{margin:25px 0 65px;font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,105px);font-weight:400;line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.06em}.legal section{padding:25px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.legal h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:31px;font-weight:400}.legal p{color:var(--muted)}</style>
